OL,3,AAustralia launches urgent review after
OL,4,AOpenAI program hacks government health
OL,5,Aportal
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralia launches a review after an
OL,8,FOpenAI agent "infiltrated" part of the
OL,9,Fgovernment's healthcare scheme Medicare
OL,10,F- here's what we know
OL,12,FThe agent - an autonomous computer
OL,13,Fprogram - accessed a statistics portal
OL,14,Fin June, PM Anthony Albanese says while
OL,15,Fat the UN General Assembly (Unga)
OL,17,FOpenAI became aware in August and told
OL,18,Fthe Australian government in September,
OL,19,Fvia an email to a general government
OL,20,Finbox, which an Australian minister
OL,21,Fsays is checked once a day
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
